{"generated": "2026-09-02 18:01", "brief": "<b>1. 미디어·엔터 기업의 경영권 매각 및 구조조정</b>\nJTBC가 새 인수자 확보를 위한 매각 절차에 돌입했으며, 워크아웃 상태인 중앙일보는 연내 워크아웃 졸업을 목표로 공개입찰을 통한 신주인수 방식의 M&amp;A를 추진합니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE9IUjA2MWFYeFdCVzZZM2d0dUtIclBkVXQ3U293bVR6ZE5QcE0zeU01MF9jN0xTSzkydVYwT2Z0eDBUeEFoTlEwaGpRX0d1SWNneE0weG9TcXBQbXh2eWFWMXJ3?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE15T2NBQm5uMWExR1c0WVJPVjJaRU5KUTM4OTNZY1F2S1lSSC04eENHNVF6S2NwX3NwMjBFN2FVVkNwWUNKVWJnN3ZFNDRUV000VWVIY0dxRGZlRExxR1E3YWNQbW1QcnI2N3ZoQmxxMjN5QUh1N0lBMQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE1wWXVycHVXOEg0QTZKbV9uOGxtYno5Sk1mS21mcnRLVklZa3lyd01nOUlCZnkyLTNkXzBtMklNU19zbzkyV2dpVUgxQXhnRUNkQ01Z?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a>]. 한편 코퍼스코리아는 75억 원 규모의 유상증자 신주 상장을 완료하며 경영권 인수와 새 경영체제 출범을 마무리 지었습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxQWjVCUzVGZlhRSEtOTnJLQ1FuMjY1bG0wTUthYzdpQUtCb2UyM1pPTml5amZEY2REVi1YUlRVSi1xcHI1QkcwUm5oLVp3eWk2MEREMHBuOGwxWkV4c05SUER2alRJbjkyOVJhRVpfVi0zMHhGLWY4U0xJWVByWUNWR0ZDeUhxYzlPU3c?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE4wbEJZUHpzWEh2elJvWUNXZDFUUnBpNERSZjBwZm52U0VLMWZ3Z3pmNUs2ZE16WFBocGJFRXNtTHdqdUNSUGNFMFNzQ3RWMnVfaks0UDZydzkyQVV0RS1XTnRxMzAzb2t2bHU2N1FDcw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a>].\n\n<b>2. 기술·플랫폼 기업의 IPO 추진 본격화</b>\n인공지능(AI) 포털 서비스 기업 뤼튼테크놀로지스(뤼튼)가 IPO 주관사 선정에 착수하며 내년 이후를 목표로 상장 준비를 본격화하고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1RMmRpU1JRMWUyMTlGMTlEN2Fvb3Q3LTNTZ2ZHZjA1TkdWTF9hUUtPNVFjU2tBZjBhUlNFWUJpR3A4S3A0SFppbm1Cb21SZXc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#21</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE92ZFVHOGFWOEp2OHJRVi1VbG9iaGNkenJKREtzV29UVUt2S3VYZHpPTFpILUprMEhub2tLMWs4WWJDdzlCTWNGemMxZkotaTZSVnl4UUR4cE9zUX